WEBVTT

00:02.435 --> 00:05.368
["Drunken Sailor" plays]
【《醉水手》播放】

00:05.435 --> 00:10.802
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

00:10.902 --> 00:12.668
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

00:12.735 --> 00:16.935
- I got some fresh ingredients
for our new Krabby Soup.
- 我有一些新鲜的食材
为我们新推出的蟹黄汤。

00:17.002 --> 00:18.602
A half-eaten Krabby Patty...
吃了一半的蟹肉饼……

00:19.768 --> 00:20.935
[splash]
[溅]

00:21.002 --> 00:22.135
Two moldy pickles...
两个发霉的泡菜...

00:22.202 --> 00:23.702
[splash]
[溅]

00:23.768 --> 00:27.202
And some smashed potatoes
that look like Squidward.
还有一些土豆泥
看起来像章鱼哥。

00:27.268 --> 00:28.768
[splash]
[溅]

00:28.902 --> 00:30.702
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

00:30.768 --> 00:33.202
- Mr. Krabs, did you get
those ingredients
- 蟹老板，你收到了吗？
那些成分

00:33.268 --> 00:34.302
from the trash?
从垃圾中？

00:34.368 --> 00:35.302
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

00:35.368 --> 00:36.968
Of course not!
当然不是！

00:37.035 --> 00:38.802
That wouldn't be legal.
那是不合法的。

00:38.902 --> 00:42.068
I intercepted these items
on their way to the trash.
我截获了这些物品
在去垃圾箱的路上。

00:42.135 --> 00:45.602
I want everybody in
Bikini Bottom to buy my soup.
我希望每个人都在
比基尼泳裤给我买汤。

00:45.668 --> 00:48.068
Yuppies, guppies, puppies...
雅皮士、孔雀鱼、小狗……

00:48.135 --> 00:49.135
- Hippies?
- 嬉皮士？

00:49.202 --> 00:50.902
- Hippies?
[growls]
- 嬉皮士？
[咆哮]

00:50.902 --> 00:53.135
- Yeah, there's a group
of hippies living out back
- 是的，有一个团体
住在后面的嬉皮士

00:53.202 --> 00:54.235
by the hydrothermal vent.
通过热液喷口。

00:54.302 --> 00:56.435
- Hippies?
- 嬉皮士？

00:56.502 --> 00:58.235
On my property?
在我的财产上？

00:58.302 --> 00:59.468
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

00:59.535 --> 01:03.335
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

01:03.402 --> 01:06.168
All right,
you longhairs, beat it!
好吧，
你们这些长毛，打败它！

01:06.235 --> 01:08.302
This here's private property!
这里是私人财产！

01:08.368 --> 01:10.202
- We're just keeping warm, dude.
- 我们只是为了取暖，伙计。

01:10.268 --> 01:11.635
- Yeah, baby.
- 是的，宝贝。

01:11.702 --> 01:14.768
We like to hang near
hydrothermal vents.
我们喜欢靠近
热液喷口。

01:14.902 --> 01:15.968
- Oof!
- 噢！

01:16.035 --> 01:17.568
- We're vent creatures.
- 我们是发泄生物。

01:17.635 --> 01:20.135
We get cold real fast.
我们很快就冷了。

01:20.202 --> 01:21.535
[laughs]
[笑]

01:21.602 --> 01:23.235
- Yeah, I don't care.
- 是的，我不在乎。

01:23.302 --> 01:25.302
You're trespassing.
你这是非法侵入。

01:25.368 --> 01:30.335
And littering paisleys!
还有乱扔佩斯利图案的！

01:30.402 --> 01:32.335
Ha-ha, back, back you go--oof!
哈哈，回来了，回来了——哎呀！

01:32.402 --> 01:33.935
[bell ringing]
[铃声响起]

01:34.002 --> 01:38.202
- Hey, freaky friends,
it's warm in here.
- 嘿，奇怪的朋友们，
这里很温暖。

01:38.268 --> 01:39.202
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

01:39.268 --> 01:40.202
[pop]
[流行音乐]

01:40.268 --> 01:41.368
[shattering]
[破碎]

01:41.435 --> 01:43.368
And keep running, you deadbeats!
继续跑吧，你们这些赖账者！

01:44.702 --> 01:47.302
- This seems just as good
as a heat vent.
- 这看起来也不错
作为散热口。

01:47.368 --> 01:48.335
[laughs]
[笑]

01:48.402 --> 01:50.235
- Let's crash this pad.
- 让我们破坏这个垫子。

01:50.302 --> 01:52.002
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:52.068 --> 01:53.202
[splash]
[溅]

01:53.268 --> 01:54.902
[crackling]
[爆裂声]

01:54.935 --> 01:57.302
- That should discourage
those bohemians.
- 这应该劝阻
那些波西米亚人。

01:57.368 --> 01:58.968
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

01:59.035 --> 02:00.368
- Hey, hold on there, lad.
- 嘿，坚持住，小伙子。

02:00.435 --> 02:02.935
You might be overdoing
the ingredients.
你可能做得太过分了
成分。

02:03.002 --> 02:06.035
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

02:06.102 --> 02:07.368
[slurps]
[啜饮]

02:07.435 --> 02:09.235
Huh, it's just broth.
呵呵，只是汤而已。

02:09.302 --> 02:11.702
- Huh, that's funny.
- 哈，这很有趣。

02:11.768 --> 02:13.902
It was loaded with stuff
a few minutes ago.
里面装满了东西
几分钟前。

02:13.968 --> 02:16.302
- Hmm, well, go ahead
and add some more.
- 嗯，好吧，继续吧
并添加更多。

02:16.368 --> 02:17.668
We got customers waiting.
我们有顾客在等待。

02:17.735 --> 02:19.435
- Aye, aye, Mr. Krabs.
- 是的，是的，蟹老板。

02:19.502 --> 02:21.102
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

02:21.168 --> 02:22.935
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

02:23.002 --> 02:24.468
[whistles]
[口哨声]

02:24.535 --> 02:25.902
[splash]
[溅]

02:25.935 --> 02:27.002
- [chomps]
- [咀嚼]

02:28.302 --> 02:31.168
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

02:31.235 --> 02:32.602
- [chomps]
- [咀嚼]

02:33.768 --> 02:35.468
- Hmm, guess I bought
the disappearing
- 嗯，我猜我买了
消失的

02:35.535 --> 02:36.935
kind of potatoes.
一种土豆。

02:37.002 --> 02:39.902
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

02:39.968 --> 02:41.168
- [chomps]
- [咀嚼]

02:41.235 --> 02:44.068
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

02:44.135 --> 02:45.302
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

02:45.368 --> 02:46.302
- Hmm?
- 唔？

02:46.368 --> 02:47.335
Oh...
哦...

02:47.402 --> 02:48.735
Oh, hungry soup, eh?
哦，饿了喝汤吧？

02:48.802 --> 02:50.435
Let's see if you like onions.
看看你喜不喜欢洋葱。

02:50.502 --> 02:55.602
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

02:55.668 --> 02:59.435
Today's special is
onion soup a la SpongeBob.
今天的特别是
海绵宝宝洋葱汤。

02:59.502 --> 03:01.502
Oh!
哦！

03:01.568 --> 03:03.602
All right, listen, soup.
好吧，听着，汤。

03:03.668 --> 03:05.268
You want me to get tough?
你想让我变得强硬吗？

03:05.335 --> 03:06.402
[grunts]
[咕哝]

03:06.468 --> 03:07.902
All right, I'll get tough!
好吧，我会变强的！

03:07.968 --> 03:11.468
I made you from scratch,
and I can unscratch you!
我从零开始创造了你
我可以帮你除掉伤痕！

03:11.535 --> 03:12.468
[crack]
[裂缝]

03:12.535 --> 03:14.135
Whoa, whoa!
哇哦！

03:15.035 --> 03:16.768
- When you're done fighting
with the food,
- 当你结束战斗时
和食物一起，

03:16.902 --> 03:19.668
we have an order
for three soups.
我们有订单
三汤。

03:19.735 --> 03:22.102
- [chewing]
- [咀嚼]

03:22.168 --> 03:24.002
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

03:24.068 --> 03:26.335
Make soup, not war.
煮汤，不是战争。

03:26.402 --> 03:28.102
[splash]
[溅]

03:28.168 --> 03:30.435
- Well, I never.
- 嗯，我从来没有。

03:30.502 --> 03:32.902
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

03:32.935 --> 03:35.468
- Ah--Achoo!
- 啊--阿呼！

03:35.535 --> 03:37.002
[blows nose]
[擤鼻子]

03:37.068 --> 03:38.902
[splash]
[溅]

03:38.902 --> 03:41.535
- Mwah!
- 哇！

03:41.602 --> 03:43.235
[whack]
[重击]

03:43.302 --> 03:46.702
- You obviously love your soup
more than you love me!
- 你显然很喜欢你的汤
胜过你爱我！

03:46.768 --> 03:49.368
- Take this soup back!
- 把这汤拿回来！

03:49.435 --> 03:51.468
- I'm returning
my husband's soup too!
- 我回来了
还有我老公的汤！

03:51.535 --> 03:52.502
- [blows a raspberry]
- [吹覆盆子]

03:52.568 --> 03:53.502
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

03:53.568 --> 03:54.568
[splash]
[溅]

03:54.635 --> 03:55.768
- What's the problem?
- 有什么问题吗？

03:55.902 --> 03:59.802
- There are hippies in the soup!
- 汤里有嬉皮士！

03:59.902 --> 04:02.168
- Hah, hippies in the soup.
- 哈，汤里的嬉皮士。

04:02.235 --> 04:03.168
That's a new one.
那是一个新的。

04:03.235 --> 04:04.335
[screams]
[尖叫声]

04:04.402 --> 04:05.535
- Avast there, ye invertebrate!
- 在那里，无脊椎动物！

04:05.602 --> 04:07.902
You're throwing away me money.
你把钱扔给我。

04:09.302 --> 04:11.235
- Anyone else down there?
- 下面还有其他人吗？

04:12.002 --> 04:16.035
- Hmm, Mr. Krabs, I think
the soup might be haunted.
- 嗯，蟹老板，我想
汤可能闹鬼了。

04:16.102 --> 04:20.568
- Son, did you forget
to pay your brain bill again?
- 儿子，你忘了吗
再次支付你的大脑账单吗？

04:20.635 --> 04:21.568
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

04:21.635 --> 04:22.602
[splash]
[溅]

04:22.668 --> 04:24.068
- Wh--What?
- 什——什么？

04:24.135 --> 04:25.502
both: [gasp]
两人：[喘气]

04:25.568 --> 04:28.102
hippies: Hey, hey, Mr. K,
how much money
嬉皮士：嘿嘿，K先生，
多少钱

04:28.168 --> 04:29.602
did you make today?
今天你做了吗？

04:29.668 --> 04:30.635
[splash]
[溅]

04:30.702 --> 04:33.935
- Oh, you hippies!
- 哦，你们这些嬉皮士！

04:34.002 --> 04:35.735
[bang]
[砰]

04:35.802 --> 04:38.135
All right, you deadbeats!
好吧，你们这些死人！

04:38.202 --> 04:39.602
This is an eviction.
这是驱逐。

04:39.668 --> 04:43.468
You are to leave
this soup immediately.
你要离开
立即喝这个汤。

04:43.535 --> 04:44.902
Huh?
Whoa!
啊？
哇！

04:44.902 --> 04:46.468
hippies: Heck no, we won't go!
嬉皮士：哎呀，不，我们不会去！

04:46.535 --> 04:50.468
all: Heck no, we won't go!
Heck no, we won't go!
所有人：哎呀，不，我们不会去！
哎呀不，我们不会去！

04:50.535 --> 04:51.668
- SpongeBob!
- 海绵宝宝！

04:51.735 --> 04:53.168
all: Heck no, we won't go!
所有人：哎呀，不，我们不会去！

04:53.235 --> 04:54.802
- Sorry, Mr. Krabs,
it's just so catchy.
- 对不起，蟹老板先生，
真是太吸引人了。

04:54.902 --> 04:56.635
- [chuckles]
Why don't you just
- [轻笑]
你为什么不直接

04:56.702 --> 04:58.168
dump the soup out?
把汤倒掉？

04:58.235 --> 05:00.902
- And lose all the money
I've already put into it?
- 并失去所有的钱
我已经投入了？

05:00.968 --> 05:03.368
Heck no!
They gotta go!
哎呀不！
他们得走了！

05:03.435 --> 05:04.735
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

05:04.802 --> 05:06.168
- Whatcha using for bait?
- 用什么做诱饵？

05:06.235 --> 05:10.202
- Something hippies love--
long hair.
- 嬉皮士喜欢的东西--
长头发。

05:13.002 --> 05:14.768
- [inhales]
- Shh!
- [吸气]
- 嘘！

05:14.902 --> 05:16.535
I got one!
- Ooh!
我得到了一个！
- 哦！

05:16.602 --> 05:17.702
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

05:17.768 --> 05:19.135
- [grumbles]
- [抱怨]

05:19.202 --> 05:21.568
Hippies can't resist
playing with this little
嬉皮士无法抗拒
玩这个小

05:21.635 --> 05:23.402
crochet foot bag.
钩针脚袋。

05:23.468 --> 05:24.402
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:24.468 --> 05:25.768
- Neither can I!
- 我也不能！

05:25.902 --> 05:29.068
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:29.135 --> 05:32.335
- Resist the temptation, dude.
- 抵制诱惑，伙计。

05:32.402 --> 05:33.902
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

05:33.902 --> 05:35.602
- Aww, but we can't let
that little bag
- 哇，但我们不能让
那个小袋子

05:35.668 --> 05:37.535
hit the ground, man!
撞到地上了，伙计！

05:37.602 --> 05:38.668
- Hah!
- 哈！

05:38.735 --> 05:40.368
[splashing]
[溅]

05:40.435 --> 05:47.235
- Cool, man, you saved the sack
from gravity, like, forever.
- 太酷了，伙计，你救了我的命
远离重力，就像永远一样。

05:47.302 --> 05:49.768
- Beautiful, man.
- 美丽，伙计。

05:49.902 --> 05:52.168
[rhythmic music]
[节奏音乐]

05:52.235 --> 05:54.735
- Mr. Krabs, why are we
in a drum circle?
- 蟹老板，我们为什么
在鼓圈里？

05:54.802 --> 05:56.535
- It's something
that all hippies
- 这是一些东西
所有嬉皮士

05:56.602 --> 05:58.535
are required to participate in.
都需要参加。

05:58.602 --> 05:59.668
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

05:59.735 --> 06:01.535
[rattling]
[嘎嘎声]

06:01.602 --> 06:03.468
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

06:03.535 --> 06:06.068
- [laughs]
Dig that beat.
- [笑]
挖掘那个节拍。

06:06.135 --> 06:11.102
- Oh, that is
a wild drum circle, dudes.
- 哦，那就是
狂野的鼓圈，伙计们。

06:11.168 --> 06:13.935
- [panting]
My hands are starting to hurt.
- [气喘吁吁]
我的手开始痛了。

06:14.002 --> 06:16.502
- Couldn't we have gotten
softer drums?
-我们难道不能得到
更柔和的鼓？

06:16.568 --> 06:17.668
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

06:17.735 --> 06:19.235
- [exclaims]
- [惊呼]

06:19.302 --> 06:20.235
I'm out.
我出去了。

06:20.302 --> 06:21.435
Oof.
钱币。

06:21.502 --> 06:22.535
[groaning]
[呻吟]

06:22.602 --> 06:23.635
- Me too.
- 我也是。

06:23.702 --> 06:25.268
[groaning]
[呻吟]

06:25.335 --> 06:28.535
- Get up, you tender palms!
It's working!
- 起来吧，你那温柔的手掌！
它正在工作！

06:28.602 --> 06:30.802
[rhythmic music]
[节奏音乐]

06:30.902 --> 06:32.668
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

06:32.735 --> 06:35.402
[groaning]
[呻吟]

06:35.468 --> 06:37.902
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

06:37.935 --> 06:39.535
[shattering]
[破碎]

06:39.602 --> 06:41.568
[screams]
[尖叫声]

06:41.635 --> 06:43.668
Oh, my claws!
哦，我的爪子！

06:43.735 --> 06:44.702
[grunts]
[咕哝]

06:44.768 --> 06:46.602
My claws.
我的爪子。

06:46.668 --> 06:49.102
I wish we had another drummer.
我希望我们有另一个鼓手。

06:49.168 --> 06:52.468
- I've got a drummer, Mr. Krabs.
- 我有一个鼓手，蟹老板。

06:52.535 --> 06:54.302
[tapping]
[窃听]

06:54.368 --> 06:55.302
hippies: [grunt]
嬉皮士：[咕哝]

06:55.368 --> 06:56.668
- Oh, man!
- 哦，伙计！

06:56.735 --> 06:58.635
Drum machines ain't cool.
鼓机并不酷。

06:58.702 --> 07:01.435
[groaning]
[呻吟]

07:01.502 --> 07:03.135
[splashing]
[溅]

07:03.202 --> 07:04.302
- [yells]
- [大喊]

07:04.368 --> 07:06.735
- It's your job
to go into that soup
- 这是你的工作
进入那个汤

07:06.802 --> 07:09.068
and remove those hippies.
并除去那些嬉皮士。

07:09.135 --> 07:10.068
[splash]
[溅]

07:10.135 --> 07:11.668
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

07:11.735 --> 07:13.702
- [gentle breathing]
- [轻柔的呼吸]

07:13.768 --> 07:16.402
[smooth music]
[流畅的音乐]

07:16.468 --> 07:17.468
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

07:17.535 --> 07:20.502
[laughter]
[笑声]

07:20.568 --> 07:22.602
[laughs]
[笑]

07:22.668 --> 07:24.035
Hello, I'm SpongeBob.
大家好，我是海绵宝宝。

07:24.102 --> 07:26.402
- Dude, it's a square.
- 老兄，这是一个正方形。

07:26.468 --> 07:30.268
- No, man, it's that crazy cook
that's been feeding us.
- 不，伙计，是那个疯狂的厨师
那一直在养活我们。

07:30.335 --> 07:35.068
- Have some carrot
love beads, SpongeBob.
- 吃点胡萝卜
爱珠子，海绵宝宝。

07:35.135 --> 07:38.268
- [chomp]
Mm, thank you!
- [咀嚼]
嗯，谢谢！

07:38.335 --> 07:40.635
Oh, Mr. Krabs sent me here
to tell you guys
噢，蟹老板派我来的
告诉你们

07:40.702 --> 07:42.068
you have to leave.
你必须离开。

07:42.135 --> 07:44.035
- Old Man Krabs
needs to mellow out.
- 蟹老翁
需要变得柔和。

07:44.102 --> 07:47.002
- Yeah, he should
try meditation.
- 是的，他应该
尝试冥想。

07:47.068 --> 07:50.768
- Ooh, like this?
- 哦，像这样吗？

07:50.902 --> 07:53.302
- Hey, you're far out.
- 嘿，你差得太远了。

07:53.368 --> 07:54.902
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

07:54.935 --> 07:57.235
- It's cool.
Up is down.
- 这很酷。
上则下。

07:57.302 --> 08:01.335
Down is up.
It's all relative.
下即是上。
这都是相对的。

08:01.402 --> 08:04.802
Relative.
相对的。

08:04.902 --> 08:08.468
- Oh, wow, SpongeBob,
you just blew our minds.
- 哦，哇，海绵宝宝，
你让我们大吃一惊。

08:08.535 --> 08:10.368
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

08:10.435 --> 08:12.502
[shimmering]
[闪烁]

08:12.568 --> 08:17.768
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

08:17.835 --> 08:19.668
- Son, how's
the eviction going?
- 儿子，怎么样
驱逐进展如何？

08:19.735 --> 08:22.568
- Oh, wow, you're beautiful.
- 哦，哇，你真漂亮。

08:22.635 --> 08:24.802
- [gasps]
You went too deep!
- [喘气]
你入戏太深了！

08:24.868 --> 08:27.302
You've gone full flower child.
你已经变成了一个十足的花童。

08:27.368 --> 08:28.735
Oh, no!
哦，不！

08:28.802 --> 08:33.635
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

08:33.702 --> 08:35.035
- What's happening, man?
- 发生什么事了，伙计？

08:35.102 --> 08:37.402
- Patrick, what are you
doing here?
- 帕特里克，你是什么？
在这里做什么？

08:37.468 --> 08:41.668
- Just tubing down the river
of life, baby.
- 只是顺流而下
生命的意义，宝贝。

08:41.735 --> 08:43.268
[chomp]
[咀嚼]

08:43.335 --> 08:44.968
- Does Mr. Krabs know
you're in here?
- 蟹老板知道吗
你在这儿吗？

08:45.035 --> 08:46.302
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

08:46.368 --> 08:47.968
- No Krabs.
- 没有螃蟹。

08:49.268 --> 08:52.568
[chomp]
[咀嚼]

08:52.635 --> 08:53.935
[spits]
[吐口水]

08:54.002 --> 08:56.202
Can't stand those things.
受不了那些东西。

08:56.268 --> 09:00.502
- Oh, oh, suddenly everything's
becoming very confusing.
- 哦，哦，突然一切都变了
变得非常混乱。

09:00.568 --> 09:02.002
I--I--I know.
我——我——我知道。

09:02.068 --> 09:03.135
I'll have a Krabby Patty.
我要一份蟹肉饼。

09:03.202 --> 09:05.302
That always calms me down.
这总是让我平静下来。

09:05.368 --> 09:07.702
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

09:07.768 --> 09:09.002
Ahh!
啊！

09:09.068 --> 09:11.002
Huh?
Huh?
啊？
啊？

09:12.268 --> 09:13.768
Hello?
你好？

09:13.902 --> 09:16.235
Anybody here?
这里有人吗？

09:16.302 --> 09:20.902
Whoa, how long
was I in that soup?
哇，多久了
我在那汤里吗？

09:20.935 --> 09:23.235
Mr. Krabs, is that you?
蟹老板，是你吗？

09:23.302 --> 09:24.568
- [inhales]
- [吸气]

09:24.635 --> 09:27.335
[exhales]
[呼气]

09:27.402 --> 09:30.902
SpongeBob, I thought
you split the scene, hipster.
海绵宝宝，我以为
你分裂了场景，时髦。

09:30.968 --> 09:32.468
- What happened here?
- 这里发生了什么？

09:32.535 --> 09:35.068
- Well, I had to close down
the Krusty Krab
- 好吧，我不得不关闭
蟹堡王

09:35.135 --> 09:38.135
since you weren't around
to make the Krabby Patties.
因为你不在身边
制作蟹黄肉饼。

09:38.202 --> 09:40.368
- Close down the Krusty Krab?
- 关掉蟹堡王？

09:40.435 --> 09:44.602
- Yeah, I was just being
a capitalist tool.
- 是的，我只是在
资本主义的工具。

09:44.668 --> 09:46.435
But it's all groovy now.
但现在一切都很时髦了。

09:46.502 --> 09:48.168
I'm a far out hippie,
我是一个彻底的嬉皮士

09:48.235 --> 09:51.902
and I'm flying
my freak flag high.
我正在飞翔
我的怪胎旗帜高高升起。

09:51.935 --> 09:54.468
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

09:54.535 --> 09:55.902
- [sniffs]
- [嗅嗅]

09:55.968 --> 09:57.502
Making Krabby Patties
was my number one
制作蟹肉饼
是我的第一名

09:57.568 --> 09:59.735
favorite thing ever
to do in the whole world.
曾经最喜欢的事情
在全世界做。

09:59.802 --> 10:01.568
- Bummer, right?
- 真糟糕，对吧？

10:01.635 --> 10:04.635
Let's dance our cares away, man.
让我们用舞蹈来消除我们的忧虑吧，伙计。

10:04.702 --> 10:08.468
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:08.535 --> 10:11.935
- Do you think that maybe
we could reopen the Krusty Krab
- 你认为也许
我们可以重新开放 Krusty Krab

10:12.002 --> 10:15.135
and go back to how things were?
并回到原来的样子？

10:15.202 --> 10:16.568
[record scratches]
【记录划痕】

10:16.635 --> 10:19.502
- I thought you'd never ask!
- Yeah!
- 我以为你永远不会问！
- 是的！

10:19.568 --> 10:22.635
But Mr. Krabs, what about
our new hippie friends?
但是蟹老板，那又如何呢？
我们的新嬉皮朋友？

10:22.702 --> 10:25.902
- They say they need
to be somewhere warm, right?
- 他们说他们需要
去一个温暖的地方，对吗？

10:25.902 --> 10:27.602
I have an idea.
我有一个主意。

10:27.668 --> 10:28.802
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:28.902 --> 10:30.502
- You know what?
- 你知道吗？

10:30.568 --> 10:33.335
That Old Man Krabs wasn't
such a bad dude after all.
蟹老翁不是
毕竟是个坏家伙。

10:33.402 --> 10:34.735
[gurgling]
[淙淙]

10:34.802 --> 10:36.368
- [laughs]
Whoa.
- [笑]
哇哦。

10:36.435 --> 10:39.702
- Someone just crashed
our new pad.
- 有人刚刚坠毁
我们的新垫。

10:39.768 --> 10:42.902
- [moaning]
- [呻吟]

10:42.902 --> 10:44.168
[splashing]
[溅]

10:44.235 --> 10:46.602
- Yo, bro, potato?
- 哟，兄弟，土豆？

10:46.668 --> 10:48.702
- Oh, thanks, man.
-哦，谢谢，伙计。

10:48.768 --> 10:49.968
[chomps]
[咀嚼]

10:50.035 --> 10:52.502
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:52.568 --> 10:53.635
[screams]
[尖叫声]

10:53.702 --> 10:55.235
Hippies!
嬉皮士！

10:58.068 --> 11:01.002
[light twangy music]
[轻快的鼻音音乐]

11:01.068 --> 11:08.102
* *
**
**
**

**